WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.961
This is it. I can't believe it.

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:05.005
It's our final hit.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:10.760
Come on you. Let's go to Kat's party.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.553
Soft launch.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.888
Don't say soft launch.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.725
God, I completely forgot.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.812
What do we do for a living?

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:23.273
We definitely don't kill people
for a living.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.733
We work in security.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:25.316
Exactly.

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:26.026
Get in here!

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.527
Are you alright with that thing, mate?

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.403
I think now I'm pretty expert.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.320
Woah!

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.700
If someone's got something you want,
you need to take control of the situation.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.952
You need to forget about Fran and move on.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.997
You got me now. And I'm not going anywhere.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:39.914
You ready?

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.461
Show time.

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:52.427
Bloody hell!

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.222
Bring him to me.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.849
I love you.
I love you too.

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:58.850
Should we kiss then?

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.894
Why do you have to make everything so weird?

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.233
Never, never mess with a funky fresh crew.

